// One description drives more than inspection: stage 0 already supplies generic
// structural equality and canonical serialization as host-side consumers.
//
// Two nullary constructors are enough to expose the contract. Two `Off` values
// compare equal and serialize identically; `Off` and `On` compare unequal and
// receive distinct tag encodings. The harness constructs those described values
// from this declaration, so the example checks the generic consumers rather
// than duplicating them as datatype-specific code.
data Bit { Off, On }

//@ mode: desc
//@ expect-desc-render: data Bit { Off = 1, On = 1 }
//@ expect-desc-unit-consumers: clean
